  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The energy levels of an atom is shown is figure.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/45e23909-e828-4c0e-bd86-7d2abbf6c866-9894466.PNG\" style=\"width: 307px; height: 225px;\" /></p><p>Which one of these transitions will result in the emission of a photon of wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>124</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math>?</p><p>Given (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
